  "planning_notes": [
    "Board is fixed to arduino:avr:uno. Wiring is preserved: TM1637 CLK=D4, DIO=D5; DHT11 data pin D7; button on D2.",
    "Program-owned port objects are created only for the explicitly required roles: D2 button input, D7 DHT temperature/humidity plus shared validity, and TM1637 display output.",
    "Serial receive is explicitly implemented with serial_command_input at 9600 baud using line_or_idle framing and idle_timeout_ms=20, with command mapping BOTH=1, HUMI=2, TEMP=3.",
    "Serial reporting uses serial_channels (outgoing only). The trigger gate is responsible for applying both the menu/report condition and the D2 serial output enable state in SysML; report cadence and menu rotation logic belong in the SysML model using elapsed_ms."
  ],
